  AVIF files made by tools/make-avif-references.py (tools/avifref/avifcorpus.py) with libavif 1.4.2's avifenc and
  avifgainmaputil over libaom 3.15.2, SVT-AV1 2.3.0 and rav1e 0.7.1, and with libaom's aomenc (BSD 2-clause, AOM Patent
