../reference/barcodes/
  Barcode reference cases and results, made by tools/make-barcode-references.py: module grids from zint 2.16.0's backend library
  (BSD-3) and read-backs of Egami's own renderings by zxing-cpp 3.1.1 (Apache-2.0). Egami's renderings are public domain.
  The ZXing blackbox test images (core/src/test/resources/blackbox of ZXing 3.5.4, Apache License 2.0, with contributed images
