ocr/
  hOCR and ALTO files written by hand for the OCR tests, in the style of what Tesseract and ABBYY FineReader write; the words
  are made up. Public domain.

fuzz/dds-seeds/
  Small DDS files for the dds fuzz target, one of each header and pixel format family, written byte by byte with random pixel
  data by a script for this repository. Public domain (CC0).

zstd/
  Zstandard files made by tools/make-zstd-references.py with zstd 1.5.6 (BSD-3) from generated text, noise and runs and from
  crops of ops/duck.png and ops/egret.png above; skippable frames written byte by byte by the script. Public domain, as their
  sources.

../reference/zstd/
  The inputs each zstd/ file decodes to, gzipped, and manifest.json, made by tools/make-zstd-references.py. Public domain.
